{
  "_note": "近 14 天事故(incidents 卡 + 首页块)。生成器 gen_cloudflare.py。逐日计数 = 创建时间串的切分计数;逐起字段(重大 / 未结 / 恢复用时)按 50 槽展开(AF 没有可用循环)。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cacheIn",
        "value": "${cache}"
      },
      "_note": "入参先落地(§9.5 #3:方法参数里的 ${} 看不见 flow 入参)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cache",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${_cacheIn},0)]"
      },
      "_note": "1 = 首页块(读缓存);组件不传 = 0。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_t0",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_zk",
        "value": "${zoneId}"
      },
      "_note": "入参先落地,键表达式里才看得见(§9.5 #3)。无域名参数的流里恒空,不影响。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_ck",
        "value": "c.cf.ic"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "_hit",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${_ck}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_hitTs",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${_hit.ts},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "页面有缓存 → 整段跳过(连接都不建);组件 / 无缓存 → 真取数。取数体里的 fail_unless 失败即终止整条流,所以走到 data.set 的一定是取到了的。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${_cache},1),if::(gt::(${_hitTs},0),0,1),1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "inc",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.cloudflarestatus.com/api/v2/incidents.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            }
          },
          "_note": "最近 50 起事故(约 110KB,覆盖大约两周多)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b",
            "value": "1"
          },
          "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${inc.incidents}),0),0,1)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "error",
              "params": {
                "errorMsg": "cf_incidents_unreachable"
              }
            }
          ],
          "_note": "取数失败 → 抛错终止流,平台据此回落上次成功数据(G26/§7.2)"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "cj",
            "value": "$[join::(pluck::(${inc.incidents},created_at),~)]"
          },
          "_note": "全部创建时间拼成一串,逐日用 split 计数(同 regions 的切分计数)。按 UTC 日期归日。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "oldD",
            "value": "$[subString::(${inc.incidents[@last].created_at},0,10)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "oldMs",
            "value": "$[parseDate::(${oldD},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "dk0",
            "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-0*86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "c0",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(split::(${cj},${dk0}))-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k0",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(parseDate::(${dk0},yyyy-MM-dd),${oldMs}),1,0)]"
          },
          "_note": "这一天在 50 起的覆盖范围内吗?不在 = 不知道,柱子不画(而不是画 0)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "dk1",
            "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-1*86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "c1",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(split::(${cj},${dk1}))-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k1",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(parseDate::(${dk1},yyyy-MM-dd),${oldMs}),1,0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "dk2",
            "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-2*86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "c2",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(split::(${cj},${dk2}))-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k2",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(parseDate::(${dk2},yyyy-MM-dd),${oldMs}),1,0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "dk3",
            "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-3*86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "c3",
            "value": "$[calc::(length::(split::(${cj},${dk3}))-1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "k3",
            "value": "$[if::(ge::(parseDate::(${dk3},yyyy-MM-dd),${oldMs}),1,0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "dk4",
            "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-4*86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
